<description>&lt;p&gt;Kenyan-led multinational forces are fighting gangs in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff while Erik Prince's Blackwater contractors use drones and air support to strike gang positions, and a secret arms deal links Haitian police to Dolly Parton’s nephew, a former lawmaker, with millions missing. Sri Lankan police STF and army contingents are being sent to Haiti, adding to a Bangladesh advance team for the UN security mission. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and allocated US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE42VmZnYzJEU2hkWTF4ekZSaW5LN2NPbFJyVHIyMFdBZ1JEVEdHUFQweXAxVjJfOXNPRFRRLXQySzlxcmpfaGI5VXBwU1dOMzE2TmxUVXlaRC1QSUdxTG01TjBjLV8zbGlIdjROMW5kSWl0YkN4Rndj?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxObDB2eGpLRVh2bFdBYkRLaFM3SmZ2VWR4Sll2eVpvQjJrNW5KU09iOFdaYnZ3VzMxRUNSTHdIMW5abC1DeEllWnBTaFpVZ1g5Y2Q0dE42bHhvTUFPcnlQYkZsbkhoZEtwemJlWmxiUUlyMjZ3R1hnLVhQRFIyUFlzN2NEOW5iTzhvTVViYW5tR0hKRUdzeVZjeUpMTjlCaWJOSG01X0tHY2Y1WXMycHBwMEFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;West Orlando News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQak5hcXpobkUxZzRxWHhUQXFKWFY1SXItMTFzY0k2Y2xuXzNBLVlMZlhyM05vdUVLN3N5a0ZEeUVoWXdzLTYtdXZoZ3Rnd2hVMHI4Q1QwbVBiQW4tUkMyMnZZclFBaVdSbXdvT1RveXV5elNJS3B6cFctSHR3R1JNWVhCbzZOblRxU0htbzRYTWVWMThVUlFZT1JFOW5TLUFGZnFGeGNPWFJhNDR5b3lqWlRubw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiru News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPbWRwdlZQd0ZlcUowSk5uUWRHNnVpdGZlZ21UUzRVQVFab3llazkyREJ2X0pTZU9keDE1R1JhZ3E3QXhjMXNWZmlOdkxjQ2t5ZW5kb3VmSHJxbHJ2SGZidnBhamx3UHp6Ym5QdnV6b